# AI tooling edits

- Keep `.cursor/` and `.claude/` **mirrored** for skills, cli catalogs, and agents unless a tool-specific note is required
- Skills: concise `SKILL.md` with `name` + third-person `description` (what + when)
- CLI catalogs: non-interactive commands only; link between test / accessibility / quality
- Update root `AGENTS.md` when adding/removing skills or agents
